# Backward compatibility:
#   Existing persisted rows carry the LEGACY composite id
#     wallet:coin:ts:side:size:price:oid
#   New rows carry the corrected id
#     wallet:coin:ts:side:size:price:oid:tid
#   The corrected id is a SUPERSET discriminator: it only ever ADDS the native trade
#   id, so any two rows distinct before remain distinct, and rows that previously
#   collided (same order, same ts/size/price) become separable.
#   Historical rows are NEVER rewritten. A one-time re-ingest of the affected window
#   accepts exactly the previously-collided executions (proven: 75 existing + 7 = 82).
